cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: >-
  OPH-FEP-Synergetics: executable correspondences, obstructions and
  complementarities across Observer Patch Holography, the Free Energy
  Principle, and Fuller's Synergetics
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    email: daniel@activeinference.institute
    affiliation: Active Inference Institute
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
  - family-names: Mueller
    given-names: Bernhard
    affiliation: Pragma Research and Active Inference Institute
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/OPH-FEP-Synergetics"
abstract: >-
  Executable probes compare finite models from Observer Patch Holography,
  the Free Energy Principle, and Fuller's Synergetics. The registry reports
  pairwise and three-way correspondences, their domains, and counterexamples.
keywords:
  - free energy principle
  - cellular sheaves
  - Synergetics
  - quadray coordinates
  - icosahedral geometry
